## Summary

Shipped a production-polished native Apple parity of `components/charts/TimeMarker.tsx` as a P4 shared surface at `apps/apple/TeslaSync/shared-surfaces/TimeMarker.*` (10 files, 1,682 LOC) — following the established precedent (0231 FSMTimelineChart).

